# The allowlist for the production image's build context, which is the repo
# root. T7.2 moved the app up from app/, so app/Dockerfile's old allowlist
# (app/Dockerfile.dockerignore) is this file without the app/ prefix; the
# compose containers (`app-test`, `app-ts`) build the `runtime` stage from the
# same context. Everything else in the repo (reference/, unitmaterial/, tmp/,
# docs/movin-v2, tools) stays out of it.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!vitest.config.ts
!src
!test
!static
!docs/admin-guide.md

# src carries the tests and the testdata (Go goldens, sample PDFs) because the
# poppler-test stage runs src/docs/convert/poppler.test.ts and
# src/render.test.ts; the app-src stage strips both before the production stage
# copies the tree, so the image itself ships neither.
